<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 700s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 8th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 700s, 358 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 101 were founded and 66 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Tang Dynasty, the Kingdom of the Franks and the Byzantine Empire.</p></header>
